Write a short introduction that explains what the reader will learn.

## First main section

Explain the first important part of the topic.

### Optional subsection

Add a subsection only when it improves understanding.

## Second main section

Continue with practical and original information.

## Common questions or problems

Address the issues readers are most likely to experience.

## Final advice

Summarize the useful points and provide a clear next step.

When relevant, link to [all question categories](/categories/) or invite the reader to [play the interactive game](/).
